From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:30:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Report the last complete WAL commit when opening storage

The incremental shipping scan stops when a commit fills a transport record. Use the full committed WAL position for OPEN, scanning synchronously only when no position has been prepared.

Exercise both open paths with a WAL produced by SQLite and verify that incremental shipping still sends whole transactions in successive records.

